                      Want a <strong style="color: #4b5563;">free cleaning?</strong> Shift is now offering <strong style="color: #4b5563;">free, professional cleaning services across NYC.</strong> Starting <strong style="color: #4b5563;">today</strong>, you can book a vetted cleaner at <strong style="color: #4b5563;">no cost</strong> and have them come right to your door.
                    </div>
```

Bold words now gray (`#4b5563`, matching the body), so they read as bold-weight only without the black contrast.
